{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0.0",
  "title": "Repos that take data from marin-data",
  "notes": [
    "One entry per repo. copies lists what the repo takes: from is a path inside marin-data, to is the path inside the consumer.",
    "sync is run in the consumer to take the new files. build rebuilds what is generated from them. check is the consumer's own check.",
    "A consumer never edits a copy. Change the data in marin-data, then sync.",
    "dependsOn names a repo whose own output is needed first, so it must be synced before this one.",
    "A consumer records the marin-data commit it last synced in marin-data.lock at its root, written by scripts/lock.sh after marin-data is pushed. Its CI checks out that commit, so a later change here cannot turn it red. With no lock file, the CI skips the comparison.",
    "sync_copies.py copies and checks every file a consumer lists, so a consumer needs no sync script of its own. A consumer whose build copies its own files (marin-pulse, marin-budget) lists no sync command."
  ],
  "consumers": [
    {
      "repo": "marin-links",
      "copies": [
        {
          "from": "organizations/agencies.json",
          "to": "data/agencies.json"
        },
        {
          "from": "organizations/agencies.schema.json",
          "to": "data/agencies.schema.json"
        },
        {
          "from": "projects/projects.json",
          "to": "data/projects.json"
        },
        {
          "from": "organizations/locations.json",
          "to": "data/locations.json"
        }
      ],
      "sync": [
        "python3 ../marin-data/scripts/sync_copies.py ."
      ],
      "build": [
        "python3 scripts/build-agencies.py",
        "python3 scripts/build-options.py"
      ],
      "check": "bash scripts/check.sh"
    },
    {
      "repo": "marin-mentions",
      "copies": [
        {
          "from": "organizations/monitors.json",
          "to": "config/organizations.json"
        },
        {
          "from": "organizations/places.json",
          "to": "config/places.json"
        },
        {
          "from": "organizations/events.json",
          "to": "config/events.json"
        },
        {
          "from": "organizations/people.json",
          "to": "config/people.json"
        },
        {
          "from": "organizations/services.json",
          "to": "config/services.json"
        },
        {
          "from": "organizations/topics.json",
          "to": "config/topics.json"
        },
        {
          "from": "projects/projects.json",
          "to": "config/projects.json"
        }
      ],
      "sync": [
        "python3 ../marin-data/scripts/sync_copies.py ."
      ],
      "build": [],
      "check": "bash scripts/check.sh",
      "notes": "Each project in the shared list with a mentions entry becomes a monitor when the app builds, so there is nothing to rebuild after the sync."
    },
    {
      "repo": "marin-reach",
      "copies": [
        {
          "from": "organizations/aliases.json",
          "to": "data/organizations-aliases.json"
        },
        {
          "from": "organizations/place-aliases.json",
          "to": "data/places-aliases.json"
        },
        {
          "from": "organizations/facilities.json",
          "to": "data/facilities.json"
        },
        {
          "from": "projects/projects.json",
          "to": "data/projects.json"
        }
      ],
      "sync": [
        "python3 ../marin-data/scripts/sync_copies.py ."
      ],
      "build": [
        "python3 scripts/build_data.py"
      ],
      "check": "bash scripts/check.sh"
    },
    {
      "repo": "marin-pulse",
      "copies": [
        {
          "from": "output/organizations.jsonld",
          "to": "organization/data/organizations.jsonld"
        },
        {
          "from": "output/jurisdictions.jsonld",
          "to": "organization/data/jurisdictions.jsonld"
        },
        {
          "from": "output/programs.jsonld",
          "to": "organization/data/programs.jsonld"
        },
        {
          "from": "output/people.jsonld",
          "to": "organization/data/people.jsonld"
        },
        {
          "from": "output/posts.jsonld",
          "to": "organization/data/posts.jsonld"
        },
        {
          "from": "output/roles.jsonld",
          "to": "organization/data/roles.jsonld"
        },
        {
          "from": "output/facilities.jsonld",
          "to": "organization/data/facilities.jsonld"
        },
        {
          "from": "organizations/place-kinds.json",
          "to": "organization/data/place-kinds.json"
        },
        {
          "from": "output/sources.json",
          "to": "organization/data/sources.json"
        },
        {
          "from": "projects/projects.json",
          "to": "projects/data/projects.json"
        },
        {
          "from": "engage/campaigns.json",
          "to": "engage/data/campaigns.json"
        }
      ],
      "sync": [],
      "build": [
        "node scripts/build-organization.js ../marin-data/output"
      ],
      "check": "bash scripts/check.sh",
      "notes": "build-organization.js copies the files itself. It also reads budgets.jsonld, budget-lines.jsonld and source/budget-display.json from output/ for the Budget tab. It reads output/statistics/ (variables, datasets and the county and places observations) for the Census section of a place's About tab. The Reach tab on each page loads Marin Reach's published data in the browser, so the build needs nothing from marin-reach. The Projects pages are built from projects/projects.json. The Engage tab on project and organization pages is built from engage/campaigns.json."
    },
    {
      "repo": "marin-budget",
      "copies": [
        {
          "from": "output/organizations.jsonld",
          "to": "data/organizations.jsonld"
        },
        {
          "from": "output/programs.jsonld",
          "to": "data/programs.jsonld"
        },
        {
          "from": "output/funds.jsonld",
          "to": "budget/data/funds.jsonld"
        },
        {
          "from": "output/sources.json",
          "to": "budget/data/sources.json"
        },
        {
          "from": "output/budgets.jsonld",
          "to": "budget/data/budgets.jsonld"
        },
        {
          "from": "output/budget-lines.jsonld",
          "to": "budget/data/budget-lines.jsonld"
        },
        {
          "from": "output/source/budget-display.json",
          "to": "budget/data/source/budget-display.json"
        },
        {
          "from": "output/budgets-2025-26.jsonld",
          "to": "budget/fy2025-26/data/budgets-2025-26.jsonld"
        },
        {
          "from": "output/budget-lines-2025-26.jsonld",
          "to": "budget/fy2025-26/data/budget-lines-2025-26.jsonld"
        },
        {
          "from": "output/funds-2025-26.jsonld",
          "to": "budget/fy2025-26/data/funds-2025-26.jsonld"
        },
        {
          "from": "output/budget-2025-26/schedules.json",
          "to": "budget/fy2025-26/data/schedules.json"
        },
        {
          "from": "output/budget-2025-26/notes.json",
          "to": "budget/fy2025-26/data/notes.json"
        },
        {
          "from": "output/cip/cip-projects.jsonld",
          "to": "capital/data/cip-projects.jsonld"
        },
        {
          "from": "output/cip/cip-budget-lines.jsonld",
          "to": "capital/data/cip-budget-lines.jsonld"
        },
        {
          "from": "output/cip/cip-budgets.jsonld",
          "to": "capital/data/cip-budgets.jsonld"
        },
        {
          "from": "output/cip/source/cip-display.json",
          "to": "capital/data/cip-display.json"
        },
        {
          "from": "output/sources.json",
          "to": "capital/data/sources.json"
        }
      ],
      "sync": [],
      "build": [
        "bash scripts/build-all.sh"
      ],
      "check": "bash scripts/check.sh",
      "notes": "build-all.sh copies the files and rebuilds every page. It also puts marin.yml in each output folder."
    },
    {
      "repo": "marin-brand",
      "copies": [
        {
          "from": "brand",
          "to": "brands",
          "dir": true,
          "ignore": [
            "*/index.html",
            "*/styles.css"
          ]
        },
        {
          "from": "schemas/brand.schema.json",
          "to": "schemas/brand.schema.json"
        }
      ],
      "sync": [
        "python3 ../marin-data/scripts/sync_copies.py ."
      ],
      "build": [
        "node scripts/build-all.js"
      ],
      "check": "bash scripts/check.sh",
      "notes": "Brands are edited in marin-data (brand/<slug>/brand.json and assets/). marin-brand keeps a copy so its Download buttons and the addresses other apps use do not change. Each brand's generated index.html, styles.css and the root brands.json belong to marin-brand."
    },
    {
      "repo": "marin-os",
      "copies": [
        {
          "from": "organizations/index.json",
          "to": "data/organizations.json"
        },
        {
          "from": "organizations/search-index.json",
          "to": "data/search-index.json"
        }
      ],
      "sync": [
        "python3 ../marin-data/scripts/sync_copies.py ."
      ],
      "build": [],
      "check": "node scripts/check-projects.js",
      "notes": "marin-os checks that every organization its project records name exists here, and that the name it shows is the official name or one of the other names. It also copies the search list that the search box on its home page reads."
    },
    {
      "repo": "marin-docs",
      "copies": [
        {
          "from": "output/regulations/manual.jsonld",
          "to": "pmrs/data/manual.jsonld"
        },
        {
          "from": "output/regulations/regulations.jsonld",
          "to": "pmrs/data/regulations.jsonld"
        },
        {
          "from": "output/regulations/definitions.jsonld",
          "to": "pmrs/data/definitions.jsonld"
        },
    {
     "from": "organizations/search-index.json",
     "to": "data/search-index.json"
    }
      ],
      "sync": [
        "python3 ../marin-data/scripts/sync_copies.py ."
      ],
      "build": [
        "node scripts/build-pmrs.js"
      ],
      "check": "bash scripts/check.sh",
      "notes": "The Personnel Management Regulations pages are built from the three regulations files. The search box on the home page also reads the list of organizations, programs, places and services (data/search-index.json)."
    },
    {
      "repo": "marin-census",
      "copies": [
        { "from": "output/statistics/variables.jsonld", "to": "data/source/variables.jsonld" },
        { "from": "output/statistics/datasets.jsonld", "to": "data/source/datasets.jsonld" },
        { "from": "output/statistics/observations", "to": "data/source/observations", "dir": true },
        { "from": "output/areas.jsonld", "to": "data/source/areas.jsonld" },
        { "from": "output/jurisdictions.jsonld", "to": "data/source/jurisdictions.jsonld" },
        { "from": "statistics/omitted-values.json", "to": "data/source/omitted-values.json" },
        { "from": "statistics/acs-mapping.json", "to": "data/source/acs-mapping.json" },
        { "from": "statistics/source/acs-2024-5yr/manifest.json", "to": "data/source/manifest.json" }
      ],
      "sync": [
        "python3 ../marin-data/scripts/sync_copies.py ."
      ],
      "build": [
        "python3 scripts/build_data.py"
      ],
      "check": "bash scripts/check.sh",
      "notes": "The statistics (ACS 5-year) and the places they are about. marin-census builds data/census.json from these files and never edits them. See statistics/README.md."
    }
  ]
}
